", "relation": "退货物流", "evidence_uids": [7], "evidence_quotes": ["客服说还没入库"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-13", "valid_from": "2026-11-13 19:53", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-13 19:53", "history": []}, "f_0025": {"fact_id": "f_0025", "text": "她担心件丢了", "subject": "HER", "relation": "情绪", "evidence_uids": [7], "evidence_quotes": ["我怕丢了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-13", "valid_from": "2026-11-13 19:53", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-13 19:53", "history": []}, "f_0026": {"fact_id": "f_0026", "text": "平台通知退款已到账，原路退回，比预计快两天", "subject": "HER", "relation": "退货退款", "evidence_uids": [8], "evidence_quotes": ["平台发通知说退款已经到账了，原路退回，比预计快了两天"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-14 10:30", "valid_from": "2026-11-14 10:38", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-14 10:38", "history": []}, "f_0027": {"fact_id": "f_0027", "text": "她换的那件外套已发货，老桂说下午到，她请我帮忙取件并把取件码发给我了", "subject": "HER", "relation": "快递代取", "evidence_uids": [9], "evidence_quotes": ["换的那件外套发货了，老桂说下午到，你帮我取一下呗，取件码我发你了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-14 下午", "valid_from": "2026-11-14 16:08", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-14 16:08", "history": []}, "f_0028": {"fact_id": "f_0028", "text": "她换的外套这次颜色对了，是米白色", "subject": "HER", "relation": "购物结果", "evidence_uids": [10], "evidence_quotes": ["这次颜色对了，米白色"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-15 11:00", "valid_from": "2026-11-15 11:08", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-15 11:08", "history": []}, "f_0029": {"fact_id": "f_0029", "text": "她提出改天请吃饭，地点是楼下那家火锅", "subject": "HER", "relation": "邀约意向", "evi